        "content": "{\n  \"analysis\": \"QEMU 8.2.2 is running but the VM remains stuck in VGA text mode (720x400, nearly all black with only a cursor). nginx/noVNC/websockify and the QEMU monitor socket are already working. The task explicitly says the image is compatible with QEMU 5.2.0, so the next step is to inspect the disk image boot structure and then try QEMU's `pc-i440fx-5.2` machine type with Cirrus VGA, which is the most direct compatibility lever before downgrading QEMU.\",\n  \"plan\": \"Inspect the image MBR/boot sector/partition table to confirm bootability. Check whether QEMU 8.2 supports `pc-i440fx-5.2`. Then restart QEMU with that machine type, Cirrus VGA, 64MB RAM, RTC localtime, while preserving snapshot mode, VNC :1, monitor socket, daemonization/pidfile. After relaunch, wait and capture screenshots to see if the VM progresses beyond text mode.\",\n  \"commands\": [\n    {\n      \"keystrokes\": \"dd if=/app/isos/win311.img of=/tmp/boot_sector.bin bs=512 count=1 2>/dev/null\\nhexdump -C /tmp/boot_sector.bin | head -40\\n\",\n      \"duration\": 0.5\n    },\n    {\n      \"keystrokes\": \"python3 << 'EOF'\\nimport struct\\nwith open('/tmp/boot_sector.bin','rb') as f:\\n    data=f.read()\\nprint(f\\\"Boot signature: {data[510]:02x} {data[511]:02x}\\\")\\nfor i in range(4):\\n    p=data[446+i*16:446+(i+1)*16]\\n    if p[4]==0:\\n        continue\\n    status=p[0]; ty=p[4]\\n    lba_start=struct.unpack('<I',p[8:12])[0]\\n    lba_size=struct.unpack('<I',p[12:16])[0]\\n    print(f\\\"Partition {i}: status=0x{status:02x}, type=0x{ty:02x}, LBA start={lba_start}, size={lba_size} sectors ({lba_size*512//1024//1024} MB)\\\")\\nEOF\\n\",\n      \"duration\": 0.5\n    },\n    {\n      \"keystrokes\": \"qemu-system-i386 -machine help | grep -E '5\\\\.2|i440fx' | head -20\\n\",\n      \"duration\": 0.5\n    },\n    {\n      \"keystrokes\": \"kill $(cat /tmp/qemu.pid 2>/dev/null) 2>/dev/null || true\\nsleep 1\\nrm -f /tmp/qemu-monitor.sock /tmp/qemu.pid\\nqemu-system-i386 \\\\\\n  -machine pc-i440fx-5.2 \\\\\\n  -drive file=/app/isos/win311.img,format=raw,snapshot=on,if=ide,index=0,media=disk \\\\\\n  -m 64 \\\\\\n  -boot c \\\\\\n  -vga cirrus \\\\\\n  -rtc base=localtime \\\\\\n  -vnc 0.0.0.0:1 \\\\\\n  -chardev socket,id=mon0,path=/tmp/qemu-monitor.sock,server=on,wait=off \\\\\\n  -mon chardev=mon0,mode=readline \\\\\\n  -daemonize \\\\\\n  -pidfile /tmp/qemu.pid\\necho \\\"QEMU exit code: $?\\\"\\n\",\n      \"duration\": 2.0\n    },\n    {\n      \"keystrokes\": \"sleep 12\\n\",\n      \"duration\": 12.0\n    },\n    {\n      \"keystrokes\": \"vncsnapshot -allowblank localhost:1 /tmp/vnc-screenshot8.jpg 2>&1 || true\\n\",\n      \"duration\": 1.0\n    },\n    {\n      \"keystrokes\": \"python3 -c \\\"from PIL import Image; img=Image.open('/tmp/vnc-screenshot8.jpg'); print('Size:', img.size); colors=img.getcolors(maxcolors=100000); print('Colors:', len(colors) if colors else '>100000'); print('Top:', sorted(colors, key=lambda x:-x[0])[:15] if colors else 'N/A')\\\"\\n\",\n      \"duration\": 0.5\n    },\n    {\n      \"keystrokes\": \"python3 -c 'import socket, time; s=socket.socket(socket.AF_UNIX, socket.SOCK_STREAM); s.connect(\\\"/tmp/qemu-monitor.sock\\\"); s.send(b\\\"info status\\\\n\\\"); time.sleep(0.5); print(s.recv(4096).decode()); s.close()'\\n\",\n      \"duration\": 1.0\n    },\n    {\n      \"keystrokes\": \"ss -ltnp | grep -E ':5901|:6080|:80 '\\n\",\n      \"duration\": 0.5\n    }\n  ]\n}",
